OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations as residents report
OL,4,Agarden 'explosion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of properties on a York street
OL,7,Fhave been evacuated after residents
OL,8,Freported an "explosion" coming from a
OL,9,Fgarden.
OL,11,FPolice and the fire service are in
OL,12,Fattendance at Crossfield Crescent in
OL,13,FFulford, following reports of a fire at
OL,14,Fabout 12:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FLewis Abley, who lives on the street,
OL,17,Fsaid he climbed onto his garage roof to
OL,18,Fsee what was going on after hearing a
OL,19,Floud bang while eating lunch.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
